# Supabase

- Browser: `@/lib/supabase/client`. Server: `@/lib/supabase/server`.
- Prefer existing RPCs (`add_cart_item`, etc.) over ad-hoc table writes from the app.
- Never commit secrets. Do not open `.env*` files.
